<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-5499] Error is reported when query with the time partition column filter.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5499</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Set the column whose data type is timestamp in the source table to the yyyy-MM-dd format when setting the partition column, and configure not to check the format of the partition column in building job, an error is reported when query with the time partition column filter.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13531266">KYLIN-5499</key>
            <summary>Error is reported when query with the time partition column filter.</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
